WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Demo run · What is the original coordinate system (Q11)? Synthetic data · single run. Not an experiment result.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Left: data file only. Right: with the manifest. The data file alone cannot answer from its material, so holding is correct.

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:20.000
The file-only agent runs code to check coordinate ranges and any CRS label. The manifest agent runs no code and reads EPSG:5186 from the column description (10 s).

4
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:34.000
The file-only agent confirms no coordinate system is recorded anywhere and holds: an appropriate hold (22 s, 2 code runs).

5
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Result: data file only, appropriate hold; manifest, grounded correct answer. A second run gave the same result.

6
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:48.500
This demo is not an experiment result. The preregistered procedure and results are published on the site's "Effect test" page.
